# 日本語コメントを多く含む小さい TS ファイル (例: web-src/core/database/
# infer-fk.ts) が git の自動判別で binary 扱いになり、diff/blame が読めなく
# なるのを防ぐ。 text と diff を明示しないと、過去に binary 扱いで格納された
# blob が引き続き Binary files differ で出力されてしまう。
*.ts text diff
*.tsx text diff
*.js text diff
*.json text diff
*.css text diff
*.md text diff
*.yml text diff
*.yaml text diff
*.html text diff
